###############################################
### INTEGRATION WITH REPOSITORIES
###############################################

# To get repository IDs for testing:

### Get All Repositories
GET {{baseUrl}}/repositories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

# Copy a repository ID from the response and use it as @repoId

###
